        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;flowchart TB\n    %% STYLING DEFINITIONS\n    classDef orch fill:#f3e8fd,stroke:#7c3aed,stroke-width:2px,color:#1e1035;\n    classDef worker fill:#e0f2fe,stroke:#0284c7,stroke-width:2px,color:#082f49;\n    classDef hitl fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706,stroke-width:2px,color:#451a03;\n    classDef mcp fill:#f1f5f9,stroke:#475569,stroke-width:2px,color:#0f172a;\n    classDef external fill:#f8fafc,stroke:#94a3b8,stroke-width:1px,color:#334155;\n    classDef feedback fill:#ffedd5,stroke:#ea580c,stroke-dasharray: 5 5,stroke-width:2px,color:#7c2d12;\n    classDef db fill:#ede9fe,stroke:#6d28d9,stroke-width:3px,color:#2e1065;\n    classDef dbWrite stroke:#8b5cf6,stroke-dasharray: 3 3,stroke-width:1.5px;\n\n    %% 1. ORCHESTRATION &amp; CONTROL PLANE\n    subgraph S1 [1. Governable Control Plane]\n        ORCH[\&quot;&lt;b&gt;eDerma Intelligence Engine&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i&gt;(Governable Orchestrator)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• Canonical Task State &amp; Contracts&lt;br/&gt;• Delegation &amp; Budgeting&lt;br/&gt;• Synthesis &amp; Decision Gates\&quot;]:::orch\n        PERSONA[\&quot;&lt;b&gt;eDerma Persona Layer&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i&gt;Clinical Brand Voice &amp; Rules&lt;/i&gt;\&quot;]:::orch\n        PERSONA -.-&gt; ORCH\n    end\n\n    %% 2. UPSTREAM INTELLIGENCE WORKERS\n    subgraph S2 [2. Upstream Intelligence Workers]\n        COMP[\&quot;&lt;b&gt;Competitor Intel Engine&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i&gt;(Worker Agent)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Market trends &amp; pricing\&quot;]:::worker\n        VOICE[\&quot;&lt;b&gt;Customer Voice Engine&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i&gt;(Worker Agent)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Reviews &amp; pain points\&quot;]:::worker\n        RAG_MGR[\&quot;&lt;b&gt;Product / Evidence Engine&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i&gt;(Worker Agent / RAG Manager)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Clinical trials &amp; claims\&quot;]:::worker\n    end\n\n    %% 3. PRODUCTION &amp; CREATIVE WORKERS\n    subgraph S3 [3. Downstream Strategy &amp; Creative Workers]\n        STRAT[\&quot;&lt;b&gt;Strategy Engine&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i&gt;(Worker Agent)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Budgets, channels, targeting\&quot;]:::worker\n        CREATIVE[\&quot;&lt;b&gt;Creative Engine&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i&gt;(Worker Agent)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Ad copy, hooks, visuals\&quot;]:::worker\n    end\n\n    %% 4. GOVERNANCE &amp; HITL\n    subgraph S4 [4. Quality &amp; Governance Gate]\n        HITL{\&quot;&lt;b&gt;Human Approval&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i&gt;(Quality &amp; Spend Gate)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• Creative review&lt;br/&gt;• Budget authorization\&quot;}:::hitl\n    end\n\n    %% 5. OUTBOUND ACTUATION &amp; AD PLATFORMS\n    subgraph S5 [5. Outbound Actuation Plane]\n        MCP_ACT[\&quot;&lt;b&gt;Ad Platform MCP Boundary&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i&gt;API Authentication &amp; Dispatch&lt;/i&gt;\&quot;]:::mcp\n        META[\&quot;&lt;b&gt;Meta Ads&lt;/b&gt;\&quot;]:::external\n        TIKTOK[\&quot;&lt;b&gt;TikTok Ads&lt;/b&gt;\&quot;]:::external\n        GOOGLE[\&quot;&lt;b&gt;Google Ads&lt;/b&gt;\&quot;]:::external\n    end\n\n    %% 6. PERFORMANCE &amp; LEARNING\n    subgraph S6 [6. Telemetry &amp; Continuous Learning]\n        METRICS[\&quot;&lt;b&gt;Performance Data Feed&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;CTR, CPA, ROAS, Spend\&quot;]:::external\n        LEARN[\&quot;&lt;b&gt;Learning Engine&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i&gt;(Worker Agent)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Attribution &amp; drift analysis\&quot;]:::worker\n    end\n\n    %% 7. INBOUND ACCESS MCP\n    MCP_DATA[\&quot;&lt;b&gt;Data Access MCP Boundary&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i&gt;Policy Filtering &amp; Row-Level Security&lt;/i&gt;\&quot;]:::mcp\n    WEB[\&quot;&lt;b&gt;eDerma Website &amp; Store&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Catalog, orders, inventory\&quot;]:::external\n\n    %% 8. UNIFIED ENTERPRISE DATABASE\n    subgraph S_DB [8. Unified Database &amp; System of Record]\n        DB[(\&quot;&lt;b&gt;eDerma Enterprise Database&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;----------------------------------------&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Catalog &amp; SKU Data&lt;/b&gt;: Products, inventory, claims&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Market Intel Store&lt;/b&gt;: Competitor pricing, scraping logs&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Customer Feedback Store&lt;/b&gt;: Reviews, sentiment logs&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Task &amp; State Ledger&lt;/b&gt;: Orchestration states, task contracts&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Strategy &amp; Brief Store&lt;/b&gt;: Audience segments, budgets&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Creative Asset Store&lt;/b&gt;: Copy variants, asset hashes&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;HITL Audit Log&lt;/b&gt;: Approval signatures, reviewer notes&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Dispatch Ledger&lt;/b&gt;: Outbound payloads, platform ad IDs&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Performance Timeseries&lt;/b&gt;: Clicks, conversions, ROAS&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Learned Memory Store&lt;/b&gt;: Validated insights, model deltas\&quot;)]:::db\n    end\n\n    %% ================= OPERATIONAL CONTROL FLOW =================\n    ORCH &lt;--&gt;|Task Grants / Scoped Intel| COMP\n    ORCH &lt;--&gt;|Task Grants / Scoped Sentiment| VOICE\n    ORCH &lt;--&gt;|Evidence Queries / Filtered Chunks| RAG_MGR\n\n    RAG_MGR &lt;--&gt;|Authorized Retrieval| MCP_DATA\n    MCP_DATA &lt;--&gt;|Product Data Queries| DB\n    WEB --&gt;|Catalog / Order Events| DB\n\n    ORCH --&gt;|Decomposed Briefs| STRAT\n    ORCH --&gt;|Decomposed Briefs| CREATIVE\n    STRAT &lt;--&gt;|Alignment| CREATIVE\n\n    STRAT --&gt;|Budget &amp; Targeting Proposal| HITL\n    CREATIVE --&gt;|Copy &amp; Asset Packages| HITL\n\n    HITL --&gt;|Signed Approval Grant| MCP_ACT\n    HITL -.-&gt;|Rejection / Redo Signal| ORCH\n\n    MCP_ACT --&gt; META\n    MCP_ACT --&gt; TIKTOK\n    MCP_ACT --&gt; GOOGLE\n\n    META --&gt; METRICS\n    TIKTOK --&gt; METRICS\n    GOOGLE --&gt; METRICS\n    METRICS --&gt; LEARN\n\n    LEARN -.-&gt;|&lt;b&gt;Continuous Learning Loop&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Validated Insights &amp; Persona Updates| ORCH\n\n    %% ================= UNIVERSAL PERSISTENCE FLOW (EVERY DATA PERSISTED) =================\n    COMP -.-&gt;|1. Raw scraped intel &amp; timestamps| DB\n    VOICE -.-&gt;|2. Ingested reviews &amp; sentiment scores| DB\n    RAG_MGR -.-&gt;|3. Retrieval logs &amp; evidence provenance| DB\n    ORCH -.-&gt;|4. Canonical task states &amp; delegation lineage| DB\n    PERSONA -.-&gt;|5. Versioned persona rules &amp; updates| DB\n    STRAT -.-&gt;|6. Campaign plans &amp; spend proposals| DB\n    CREATIVE -.-&gt;|7. All generated copy variants &amp; prompts| DB\n    HITL -.-&gt;|8. Reviewer identity, approvals &amp; rejections| DB\n    MCP_ACT -.-&gt;|9. Platform dispatch logs &amp; transaction IDs| DB\n    METRICS -.-&gt;|10. Raw timeseries telemetry data| DB\n    LEARN -.-&gt;|11. Attribution models &amp; learned deltas| DB&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="CUDhMBtbQreBq1B5f8Qv-139">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
