        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;flowchart TB\n    %% STYLING\n    classDef orch fill:#f3e8fd,stroke:#7c3aed,stroke-width:2px,color:#1e1035;\n    classDef worker fill:#e0f2fe,stroke:#0284c7,stroke-width:2px,color:#082f49;\n    classDef gate fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706,stroke-width:2px,color:#451a03;\n    classDef mcp fill:#f1f5f9,stroke:#475569,stroke-width:2px,color:#0f172a;\n    classDef external fill:#f8fafc,stroke:#94a3b8,stroke-width:1px,color:#334155;\n    classDef db fill:#ede9fe,stroke:#6d28d9,stroke-width:3px,color:#2e1065;\n\n    %% 1. ORCHESTRATION &amp; BRAND GOVERNANCE\n    subgraph S1 [1. Control Plane &amp; Brand Core]\n        ORCH[\&quot;&lt;b&gt;Brand Intelligence Engine&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i&gt;(Governable Orchestrator)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Canonical State • Task Contracts • Budgets\&quot;]:::orch\n        PERSONA[\&quot;&lt;b&gt;Brand Persona &amp; Policy Layer&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Voice • Design System • Compliance Rules\&quot;]:::orch\n        PERSONA --&gt;|Enforces Rules| ORCH\n    end\n\n    %% 2. INTELLIGENCE &amp; KNOWLEDGE\n    subgraph S2 [2. Upstream Intelligence &amp; Knowledge]\n        COMP[\&quot;&lt;b&gt;Competitor Intel Engine&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i&gt;(Worker)&lt;/i&gt; Trends &amp; Pricing\&quot;]:::worker\n        VOICE[\&quot;&lt;b&gt;Customer Voice Engine&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i&gt;(Worker)&lt;/i&gt; Sentiment &amp; Reviews\&quot;]:::worker\n        RAG[\&quot;&lt;b&gt;Evidence / RAG Manager&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i&gt;(Worker)&lt;/i&gt; Specs, Claims &amp; Case Studies\&quot;]:::worker\n    end\n\n    %% 3. FUNCTIONAL PRODUCTION ENGINES\n    subgraph S3 [3. Functional Domain Production]\n        STRAT[\&quot;&lt;b&gt;Strategy Engine&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i&gt;(Worker)&lt;/i&gt; Omnichannel &amp; Spend Plans\&quot;]:::worker\n        CREATIVE[\&quot;&lt;b&gt;Creative &amp; Content Engine&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i&gt;(Worker)&lt;/i&gt; Copy, Social Posts, Assets\&quot;]:::worker\n        WEB_DEV[\&quot;&lt;b&gt;Website &amp; Dev Engine&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i&gt;(Worker)&lt;/i&gt; CMS, Code, Catalog &amp; Ops\&quot;]:::worker\n    end\n\n    %% 4. GOVERNANCE GATEWAY\n    subgraph S4 [4. Quality &amp; Risk Gateway]\n        HITL{\&quot;&lt;b&gt;Human Approval Gate&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Budget, Brand, Legal &amp; Deploy Sign-Off\&quot;}:::gate\n    end\n\n    %% 5. OUTBOUND CAPABILITY (MCP)\n    subgraph S5 [5. Outbound Execution Gateways]\n        MCP_ACT[\&quot;&lt;b&gt;Actuation &amp; Publishing MCP&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;API Security, Payload Packaging, Dispatch\&quot;]:::mcp\n    end\n\n    %% 6. EXTERNAL CHANNELS &amp; PLATFORMS\n    subgraph S6 [6. External Runtimes &amp; Endpoints]\n        ADS[\&quot;&lt;b&gt;Paid Ad Platforms&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Meta • Google • TikTok • LinkedIn\&quot;]:::external\n        SOCIAL[\&quot;&lt;b&gt;Organic Social Channels&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Instagram • X • YouTube • TikTok\&quot;]:::external\n        SITE[\&quot;&lt;b&gt;Live Website / CMS / App&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Storefront • Blog • Portfolio • SaaS\&quot;]:::external\n    end\n\n    %% 7. TELEMETRY &amp; FEEDBACK\n    subgraph S7 [7. Telemetry &amp; Continuous Learning]\n        PERF[\&quot;&lt;b&gt;Performance Data Feed&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Traffic, Conversions, CTR, CPA, ROAS, Errors\&quot;]:::external\n        LEARN[\&quot;&lt;b&gt;Learning Engine&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i&gt;(Worker)&lt;/i&gt; Attribution &amp; Insight Extraction\&quot;]:::worker\n    end\n\n    %% 8. UNIVERSAL DATABASE (SYSTEM OF RECORD)\n    subgraph S8 [8. Unified Database &amp; System of Record]\n        DB[(\&quot;&lt;b&gt;Unified Enterprise Database&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;=======================================&lt;br/&gt;• Brand Rules, Design Tokens &amp; Policies&lt;br/&gt;• Scraped Competitor Intel &amp; Timestamps&lt;br/&gt;• Customer Feedback, Reviews &amp; Tickets&lt;br/&gt;• Vector Chunks, Product Specs &amp; Evidence&lt;br/&gt;• Task Contracts, Runs &amp; Delegation Trees&lt;br/&gt;• Strategy Briefs, Target Segments &amp; Bids&lt;br/&gt;• Generated Copy, Asset Hashes &amp; Code Diffs&lt;br/&gt;• Human Approval Signatures &amp; Audit Logs&lt;br/&gt;• Dispatched Payloads &amp; Remote Entity IDs&lt;br/&gt;• Raw Timeseries Telemetry &amp; Server Logs&lt;br/&gt;• Attribution Weights &amp; Learned Heuristics\&quot;)]:::db\n    end\n\n    %% OPERATIONAL CONTROL FLOW\n    ORCH &lt;--&gt;|Scoped Work Orders / Intel| COMP\n    ORCH &lt;--&gt;|Scoped Work Orders / Sentiment| VOICE\n    ORCH &lt;--&gt;|Evidence Queries / Filtered Chunks| RAG\n\n    ORCH --&gt;|Campaign Goals| STRAT\n    ORCH --&gt;|Content Calendars| CREATIVE\n    ORCH --&gt;|Dev &amp; CMS Directives| WEB_DEV\n\n    RAG -.-&gt;|Grounded Truth| CREATIVE\n    RAG -.-&gt;|Specifications| WEB_DEV\n    STRAT &lt;--&gt;|Alignment| CREATIVE\n    CREATIVE &lt;--&gt;|Assets &amp; Layouts| WEB_DEV\n\n    STRAT --&gt;|Spend Proposals| HITL\n    CREATIVE --&gt;|Content Proposals| HITL\n    WEB_DEV --&gt;|Deploy &amp; Config Proposals| HITL\n\n    HITL --&gt;|Authorized Grants| MCP_ACT\n    HITL -.-&gt;|Rejection / Revision| ORCH\n\n    MCP_ACT --&gt;|Campaign Payloads| ADS\n    MCP_ACT --&gt;|Scheduled Posts| SOCIAL\n    MCP_ACT --&gt;|Code &amp; CMS Updates| SITE\n\n    ADS --&gt; PERF\n    SOCIAL --&gt; PERF\n    SITE --&gt; PERF\n\n    PERF --&gt; LEARN\n    LEARN -.-&gt;|&lt;b&gt;Continuous Learning Loop&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Validated Insights &amp; Persona Weights| ORCH\n\n    %% UNIVERSAL DATA PERSISTENCE (EVERY NODE COMMITS TO DB)\n    PERSONA -.-&gt;|Brand Rules &amp; Tokens| DB\n    ORCH -.-&gt;|Task Contracts &amp; State Logs| DB\n    COMP -.-&gt;|Scraped Market Snapshots| DB\n    VOICE -.-&gt;|Raw Reviews &amp; Sentiment| DB\n    RAG &lt;==&gt;|Read/Write Vectors &amp; Evidence| DB\n    STRAT -.-&gt;|Budgets &amp; Target Profiles| DB\n    CREATIVE -.-&gt;|Copy, Prompts &amp; Asset Hashes| DB\n    WEB_DEV -.-&gt;|Code Diffs, CMS Pages, Orders| DB\n    HITL -.-&gt;|Reviewer Signatures &amp; Logs| DB\n    MCP_ACT -.-&gt;|Dispatched Payloads &amp; IDs| DB\n    PERF -.-&gt;|Raw Telemetry &amp; Event Streams| DB\n    LEARN -.-&gt;|Attribution &amp; Memory Deltas| DB\n    SITE -.-&gt;|Catalog &amp; Order Records| DB&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="CUDhMBtbQreBq1B5f8Qv-591">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
