        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;flowchart TB\n    %% STYLING DEFINITIONS\n    classDef orch fill:#f3e8fd,stroke:#7c3aed,stroke-width:2px,color:#1e1035;\n    classDef rag fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#1d4ed8,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#0f172a;\n    classDef worker fill:#e0f2fe,stroke:#0284c7,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#082f49;\n    classDef gate fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706,stroke-width:2px,color:#451a03;\n    classDef mcp fill:#f1f5f9,stroke:#475569,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#0f172a;\n    classDef external fill:#f8fafc,stroke:#94a3b8,stroke-width:1px,color:#334155;\n    classDef db fill:#ede9fe,stroke:#6d28d9,stroke-width:3px,color:#2e1065;\n    classDef loop fill:#ffedd5,stroke:#ea580c,stroke-dasharray: 4 4,stroke-width:2px,color:#7c2d12;\n\n    %% 1. TIER 1: SPECIALIZED WORKER AGENTS (ISOLATED EXECUTION)\n    subgraph TIER1 [Tier 1: Specialized Domain Agents -- Isolated Tools, Skills &amp; Context]\n        direction TB\n        AG_COMP[\&quot;&lt;b&gt;Market &amp; Competitor Engine&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Pricing, trend tracking &amp; benchmark intel\&quot;]:::worker\n        AG_VOICE[\&quot;&lt;b&gt;Audience &amp; Customer Voice Engine&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Sentiment analysis, reviews &amp; ticket mining\&quot;]:::worker\n        AG_DEV[\&quot;&lt;b&gt;Brand Dev &amp; Engineering Engine&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;UI/UX design, CMS schemas, frontend/backend code\&quot;]:::worker\n        AG_STRAT[\&quot;&lt;b&gt;Strategy Engine&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Omnichannel campaign planning &amp; budget allocation\&quot;]:::worker\n        AG_CONTENT[\&quot;&lt;b&gt;Creative &amp; Content Engine&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Copywriting, media assets &amp; social content\&quot;]:::worker\n        AG_OPS[\&quot;&lt;b&gt;Operations Engine&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;E-commerce SKUs, portfolio assets, CMS pages, orders\&quot;]:::worker\n        AG_LEARN[\&quot;&lt;b&gt;Learning Engine&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Attribution modeling, decay scoring &amp; heuristics\&quot;]:::worker\n    end\n\n    %% 2. TIER 2: CENTRAL ORCHESTRATION &amp; ACCESS CONTROL\n    subgraph TIER2 [Tier 2: Central Orchestration &amp; Access Control Plane]\n        ORCH[\&quot;&lt;b&gt;Intelligence Engine (Orchestrator)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;--------------------------------------------------&lt;br/&gt;• Exclusive Data Access Controller&lt;br/&gt;• Task Contracts, Canonical State &amp; Budgets&lt;br/&gt;• Monotonic Attenuation &amp; Boundary Enforcement&lt;br/&gt;• Sole Intermediary between Agents and Data Layer\&quot;]:::orch\n        PERSONA[\&quot;&lt;b&gt;Brand Persona &amp; Policy Layer&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Brand voice, clinical tone, legal disclaimers &amp; design tokens\&quot;]:::orch\n        PERSONA --&gt;|Enforces Rules| ORCH\n    end\n\n    %% 3. TIER 3: AUTHORITATIVE DATA MANAGEMENT (AGENTIC RAG)\n    subgraph TIER3 [Tier 3: Authoritative Data Management Layer]\n        RAG_MGR[\&quot;&lt;b&gt;Agentic RAG Engine&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;--------------------------------------------------&lt;br/&gt;• Sole Authority over Database &amp; Website Data&lt;br/&gt;• Ingestion, Vectorization, Chunking &amp; Schemas&lt;br/&gt;• Retrieval Filtering, Freshness Checks &amp; Auditing&lt;br/&gt;• Universal Data Persistence Manager\&quot;]:::rag\n        MCP_DATA[\&quot;&lt;b&gt;Data &amp; CMS MCP Gateway&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Protocol Isolation, Transaction Boundaries, Web Sync\&quot;]:::mcp\n        RAG_MGR &lt;--&gt;|Controls| MCP_DATA\n    end\n\n    %% 4. TIER 4: PERSISTENT SYSTEM OF RECORD &amp; RUNTIMES\n    subgraph TIER4 [Tier 4: Single Persistent Source of Truth &amp; Public Platforms]\n        DB[(\&quot;&lt;b&gt;Central Enterprise Database&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;=====================================================&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Catalog &amp; Storefront Data&lt;/b&gt;: Products, SKUs, inventory, CMS articles&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Market &amp; Voice Lake&lt;/b&gt;: Scraped competitor intel, customer reviews&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Task &amp; Run Ledger&lt;/b&gt;: Agent task contracts, execution traces, checkpoints&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Production Artifacts&lt;/b&gt;: Code diffs, CMS schemas, copy variants, assets&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;HITL Audit Log&lt;/b&gt;: Human approval signatures, spend authorizations&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Actuation Ledger&lt;/b&gt;: Outbound payloads, platform post/ad IDs&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Performance Timeseries&lt;/b&gt;: Live metrics, conversions, traffic, logs&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Learned Memory Store&lt;/b&gt;: Attribution weights, system updates\&quot;)]:::db\n        WEBSITE[\&quot;&lt;b&gt;Website &amp; Digital Platforms&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Live Storefront • CMS Blog • Portfolio • Web App\&quot;]:::external\n        MCP_DATA &lt;==&gt;|Authoritative Read/Write &amp; Indexing| DB\n        MCP_DATA &lt;==&gt;|Authoritative Sync &amp; Content Deploys| WEBSITE\n    end\n\n    %% 5. GOVERNANCE, ACTUATION &amp; CLOSED LOOP\n    subgraph TIER5 [Outbound Governance, Actuation &amp; Telemetry Loop]\n        HITL{\&quot;&lt;b&gt;Human Approval Gate&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Spend, Brand, Code &amp; Legal\&quot;}:::gate\n        MCP_ACT[\&quot;&lt;b&gt;Ad &amp; Social MCP Boundary&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;API Security &amp; Dispatch\&quot;]:::mcp\n        EXT_CH[\&quot;&lt;b&gt;External Channels&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Meta • TikTok • Google • LinkedIn • X\&quot;]:::external\n        PERF_DATA[\&quot;&lt;b&gt;Performance Data Feed&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;CTR, CPA, ROAS, Traffic, Errors\&quot;]:::external\n    end\n\n    %% ================= RELATIONAL PIPELINE =================\n    %% Relationship: Specialized Agents &lt;==&gt; Intelligence Engine (Read-Only Data Requests &amp; Upward Outputs)\n    AG_COMP &lt;==&gt;|Read-Only Inquiries / Scraped Intel| ORCH\n    AG_VOICE &lt;==&gt;|Read-Only Inquiries / Sentiment Signals| ORCH\n    AG_DEV &lt;==&gt;|Read-Only Inquiries / Code &amp; Schemas| ORCH\n    AG_STRAT &lt;==&gt;|Read-Only Inquiries / Campaign Plans| ORCH\n    AG_CONTENT &lt;==&gt;|Read-Only Inquiries / Creative Drafts| ORCH\n    AG_OPS &lt;==&gt;|Read-Only Inquiries / Ops &amp; Catalog Deltas| ORCH\n    AG_LEARN &lt;==&gt;|Read-Only Inquiries / Learned Heuristics| ORCH\n\n    %% Relationship: Intelligence Engine &lt;==&gt; Agentic RAG\n    ORCH &lt;==&gt;|&lt;b&gt;Authorized Data Requests&lt;/b&gt; (Queries)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Universal Persistence Streams&lt;/b&gt; (All Agent Outputs)| RAG_MGR\n\n    %% ================= OUTBOUND ACTION &amp; CLOSED-LOOP FLOW =================\n    %% Proposals to HITL\n    ORCH --&gt;|Proposals Requiring Human Sign-Off| HITL\n    HITL --&gt;|Approved &amp; Signed Grants| MCP_ACT\n    HITL -.-&gt;|Rejection / Revision Directives| ORCH\n\n    %% Execution &amp; Telemetry\n    MCP_ACT --&gt;|Campaign Payloads &amp; Social Posts| EXT_CH\n    EXT_CH --&gt;|Telemetry Webhooks| PERF_DATA\n    WEBSITE --&gt;|Traffic &amp; Transaction Logs| PERF_DATA\n\n    %% Feedback to Learning Engine -&gt; Intelligence Engine\n    PERF_DATA --&gt;|Raw Metric Streams| AG_LEARN\n    AG_LEARN -.-&gt;|&lt;b&gt;Continuous Learning Loop&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Performance Attribution &amp; Memory Updates| ORCH&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="jNLb2qwnlkjZBGXYwLNb-1">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
